Five commands worth memorising
ip addr


Displays IP addresses and network interfaces.
ping -c 4 google.com


Tests connectivity and DNS resolution.
uname -a


Displays Linux system information.
whoami


Displays the current username.
ls /media/sf_VMShare


Lists files in a typical auto-mounted VirtualBox shared folder.
